WEBVTT

00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:00.272
he put the gun down.

00:06:01.899 --> 00:06:04.026
And that, that right there --

00:06:04.068 --> 00:06:05.236
(Applause)

00:06:05.277 --> 00:06:07.238
is where the cycle of violence stopped.

00:06:07.279 --> 00:06:08.781
(Applause)

00:06:09.115 --> 00:06:10.574
That's everything.

00:06:12.535 --> 00:06:15.413
I have other stories
like Walter and Eluvia's.

00:06:15.454 --> 00:06:18.916
But to interrupt and to stop
this epidemic of violence,

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:20.793
we need thousands more.

00:06:21.836 --> 00:06:24.797
And there are great ways
to do this that are replicable.

00:06:26.006 --> 00:06:29.844
We know that we can provide
more health care in communities

00:06:29.844 --> 00:06:31.846
provided by regular people.